// soh/src/code/z_collision_check.c only (CollisionCheck_SetATvsAC / CollisionCheck_ApplyDamage).
// Tags on the attacks: combo/rando/CrossDamageTags.h. Doc: docs/combo/forms-audit.md "Form attacks vs enemies".
